<Base title="Privacy notice | Adhuni HR Solutions" noindex><section class="detail-hero"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow light">YOUR INFORMATION</div><h1>Privacy notice.</h1><p>Information about the website enquiry form.</p></div></section><section class="section"><article class="container detail-content"><p><strong>Preview notice:</strong> this website is being prepared for launch. Enquiry collection is disabled by default. The company must approve its final privacy notice and contact details before enabling the form.</p><h2>Information entered in the form</h2><p>The forms ask for contact details and the information relevant to your hiring requirement, career profile or general enquiry. Candidates can provide qualifications, experience, skills, passport status and an optional CV. General enquiries can include an optional attachment. Please do not send passport scans, identity numbers or unrelated sensitive information.</p><h2>When the form is enabled</h2><p>Enquiries and optional attachments are saved to the company’s enquiry spreadsheet and Google Drive folder so the team can respond to the request. Candidate information may be shared with relevant employers for recruitment purposes. This website does not create a candidate account or a separate CV database. Spam protection may use Cloudflare Turnstile. Hosting and these service providers, including Google, may process technical information needed to deliver and protect the service.</p><h2>Preview mode</h2><p>In preview mode, submitting the form does not send or store the details entered. This build does not include advertising trackers or a candidate account database.</p><h2>Before launch</h2><p>The final notice must identify the responsible legal entity, privacy contact, retention period, applicable rights and any international transfer arrangements. These details have not been supplied and are not assumed in this preview.</p><a href="/" class="button navy">Return to the website →</a></article></section></Base>
